stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state if_state <<choice>>
    [*] --> IsPositive
    IsPositive --> if_state
    if_state --> False : if n < 0
    if_state --> True : if n >= 0
    state fork_state <<fork>>
    True --> fork_state
    fork_state --> SquareRoot
    fork_state --> Logarithm

    state join_state <<join>>
    SquareRoot --> join_state
    Logarithm --> join_state
    join_state --> Report
    Report --> [*]
